OL,3,GNEWSAEA clarifies use of halal chicken
OL,4,Ain school canteens after
OL,5,A'misinformation'
OL,6,
OL,7,FEducation officials have clarified the
OL,8,Fuse of halal chicken in Northern
OL,9,FIreland school canteens after what they
OL,10,Fdescribed as "misinformation"
OL,11,Fcirculating online.
OL,13,FThe Education Authority (EA), which
OL,14,Foversees schools, said it was putting
OL,15,Fout the information as it had been
OL,16,F"singled out for online commentary" at
OL,17,Fthe start of the new school term.
OL,19,FThe authority said that the decision to
OL,20,Fserve some halal chicken as part of
OL,21,Fschool meals was mainly down to
OL,22,Fsupplies of chicken.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
