OL,3,GNEWSAEA clarifies use of halal chicken
OL,4,Ain school canteens after
OL,5,A'misinformation'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHalal food is prepared according to
OL,8,Fstrict Islamic dietary laws which
OL,9,Fforbid the consumption of pork or
OL,10,Falcohol; halal meat requires a
OL,11,Fprescribed method of animal slaughter.
